unter ≈ `INT_MAX`, accumulator wrapped) | [x] |\n| C56 | all 12 | **full-pipeline replay**: 2000-step randomized sequence mixing *every* entry point and both state axes, comparing every return value and every buffer byte at every step | [x] |\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false}}
